  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "This paper proposes a hybrid QCGAN-QAE framework for EU ETS carbon-market risk estimation using 8 qubits, 3-day historical conditioning, and 90%/95%/99% confidence levels. The best reported QCGAN-QAE results are VaR failure ratios of 9.06%, 5.83%, and 0.97%, with CVaR errors of 1.5217, 0.3417, and 6.7714; binary-search-enhanced QAE reduces runtime to about 0.0020–0.0021 s, but the work does not demonstrate practical quantum advantage over classical methods.",
